name: sum_divisors
ret: int
kind: loop
sig: fn sum_divisors(n: int) -> [] int
desc: The sum of all positive divisors of n, including 1 and n. sum_divisors(10) is 18. Domain: 1 <= n <= 5000.
example: sum_divisors(6) == 12
example: sum_divisors(1) == 1
example: sum_divisors(10) == 18
